# cmake options of GEANT4 V11.1.3, read by recipes/GEANT4/build.sh (one per line; '#' starts a comment).
# The install prefix is added by build.sh.
#
# The features of the existing V11.1.3 (geant4-config --features, Geant4Config.cmake): Release, C++17,
# multithreading, builtin CLHEP, zlib and PTL, GDML, Qt5 (with Qt3D, which 11.1 enables by itself when
# qt5-qt3d-devel is installed), OpenGL X11, and the data sets installed in the prefix.
# 11.1 knows only Qt5, so there is no GEANT4_USE_QT_QT5/QT6 option.

-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
-DCMAKE_CXX_STANDARD=17
-DGEANT4_BUILD_MULTITHREADED=ON
-DGEANT4_INSTALL_DATA=ON
-DGEANT4_INSTALL_EXAMPLES=ON
-DGEANT4_USE_GDML=ON
-DGEANT4_USE_QT=ON
-DGEANT4_USE_OPENGL_X11=ON
-DGEANT4_USE_SYSTEM_CLHEP=OFF
-DGEANT4_USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB=OFF
-DGEANT4_USE_SYSTEM_PTL=OFF
